        <mxCell id="b22" value="How to read this page&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:normal;&quot; color=&quot;#FF9900&quot;&gt;Start top left and follow the arrows&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1460" y="70" width="440" height="64" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b23" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;T1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#EC7211&quot;&gt;bootstrap&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Creates the state bucket. Built once, on its own, because Terraform needs somewhere to keep its state before it can build anything else.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;T2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#EC7211&quot;&gt;envs/dev&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The folder where the commands are run. Keeps its state in that bucket and calls each module.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;T3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#EC7211&quot;&gt;network&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Builds the VPC. Needs nothing from the other modules, so it is built at the same time as T4.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;T4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#EC7211&quot;&gt;kms&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Creates the key. Its key ARN flows to the evidence bucket, the IAM policy, the log groups and the server&#39;s disk.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;T4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#EC7211&quot;&gt;evidence&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Creates the bucket, encrypted with that key. Its bucket ARN flows to T5.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;T5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#EC7211&quot;&gt;iam&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Writes the upload policy, which names that bucket and key. Its instance profile flows to T7.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;T6&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#EC7211&quot;&gt;logging&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Creates the encrypted log groups. They must exist before the server boots, or the CloudWatch agent would create unencrypted ones (dashed arrow).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;T7&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#EC7211&quot;&gt;compute&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Launches the server. Needs the subnet and security group (T3), the key (T4), the role (T5) and the log groups (T6), so it comes near the end.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;T8&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#EC7211&quot;&gt;monitoring&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Switches on Config and Security Hub last, so they watch the finished build.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ARROWS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Solid: a value passed to the next step. Dashed: an ordering rule (depends_on), no value passed. Terraform works out the order from these arrows, and destroy removes all 52 resources in reverse." style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;spacingTop=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FF9900;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1460" y="142" width="440" height="788" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="3 First boot of the server" id="c">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1246" dy="698" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2120" pageHeight="1020" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="c1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#232F3E;" value="First boot: how the server sets itself up with nobody logging in" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="1000" x="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;0. terraform apply&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;templatefile() fills cloud-init.yaml.tftpl&lt;br&gt;with harden.sh and cis-check.sh&lt;br&gt;(base64) and sends it as user data" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="250" x="40" y="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Server starts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;cloud-init reads the user data&lt;br&gt;once, at first boot" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="250" x="340" y="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;2. write_files&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;harden.sh, cis-check.sh,&lt;br&gt;cis-check.service, cis-check.timer,&lt;br&gt;CloudWatch agent settings" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="250" x="640" y="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;3. runcmd: harden.sh&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;root login off, unused services masked,&lt;br&gt;file permissions, auditd + rules,&lt;br&gt;automatic security updates" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="250" x="940" y="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c6" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;4. runcmd: tools&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;jq (apt, through NAT)&lt;br&gt;AWS CLI (snap, through NAT)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="250" x="940" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;5. runcmd: CloudWatch agent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;download through S3 gateway endpoint,&lt;br&gt;install, load settings, start" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="250" x="640" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c8" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;6. runcmd: timer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;systemctl enable --now cis-check.timer&lt;br&gt;systemctl start cis-check.service&lt;br&gt;(first check runs now)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="250" x="340" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c9" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;7. cis-check.sh&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;10 checks, each PASS or FAIL&lt;br&gt;JSON saved in /var/log/cis-evidence/" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="250" x="40" y="410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c10" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;8. Evidence bucket&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;uploaded to evidence/&amp;lt;instance-id&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;date&amp;gt;/&lt;br&gt;encrypted with the KMS key" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="250" x="420" y="410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c11" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;9. CloudWatch /cis/evidence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;the agent ships the same JSON file&lt;br&gt;to CloudWatch Logs" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="250" x="420" y="560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c12" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;10. Every day at 00:00&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;the timer runs cis-check.sh again&lt;br&gt;(Persistent=true: a missed run&lt;br&gt;happens at next boot)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="250" x="40" y="560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c13" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" target="c3" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
