        <mxCell id="c23" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" value="&lt;b&gt;Proof it worked (this build)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;cloud-init status: done&lt;br&gt;/var/log/cis-hardening.log ends with CIS hardening finished&lt;br&gt;first evidence file 10/10 PASS about 10 seconds later&lt;br&gt;log streams named after the instance in /cis/auth and /cis/evidence" vertex="1">
